---
layout: base.njk
title: Professional Record
description: Albert Chang is a community-centered engineer developing renewable-energy projects that turn climate goals into practical infrastructure.
pageModule: /assets/js/experience-timeline.js
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ site.brandLine }}</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">A community-centered engineer developing renewable-energy projects that turn climate goals into practical infrastructure.</h1>
    <p class="intro">I’m building this Professional Record to connect the work I’ve done with the direction I’m still shaping.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="portrait-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Portrait placeholder for Albert Chang">
    <span>Portrait placeholder</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="experience" class="section-shell experience-section" aria-label="Experience" data-experience-timeline>
  <p class="eyebrow">Experience</p>
  <h2 id="experience-title">Experience Timeline</h2>
  <ol class="experience-timeline" aria-label="Experience Timeline">
    {% for entry in experience %}
      <li class="experience-entry" data-timeline-entry>
        <div class="experience-marker-slot" aria-hidden="true">
          {% if entry.marker %}<img src="{{ entry.marker.src | url }}" alt="">{% else %}<span class="experience-marker"></span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <article>
          <h3>{{ entry.company }}</h3>
          <p class="experience-entry__role">{{ entry.role }}</p>
          <dl class="experience-entry__facts">
            <div><dt>Location</dt><dd>{{ entry.location }}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Dates</dt><dd>{{ entry.startDate }} – {{ entry.currentLabel or entry.endDate }}</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </article>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<section id="about" class="section-shell narrative-section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
  <h2 id="about-title">A connected first-person narrative, still in progress.</h2>
  <p>I’ll use this space to reflect on the values, objectives, and interests behind my work. For now, this honest placeholder marks the shape of that story without turning unfinished ideas into claims.</p>
</section>

<section id="education" class="section-shell education-preview" aria-label="Education Journey preview">
  <p class="eyebrow">Education Journey</p>
  <h2 id="education-title">Learning in context, not just credentials.</h2>
  <p>Degree details for Carnegie Mellon University and the University of California San Diego are pending confirmation. The full Education Journey reserves room for verified formative decisions, leadership, service, and academic Projects.</p>
  <a class="text-link" href="{{ '/education/' | url }}">Explore the Education Journey</a>
</section>
